\textbf{(b)}
\[A=\int_0^{2\pi}\int_0^{2(1+\cos\theta)}r\,dr\,d\theta-\int_{-\pi/2}^{\pi/2}\int_0^{2\cos\theta}r\,dr\,d\theta=\int_0^{2\pi}2(1+\cos\theta)^2d\theta-\int_{-\pi/2}^{\pi/2}2\cos^2\theta\,d\theta=6\pi-\pi=\boxed{5\pi}.\]
